+
+  /************************************************************************
+   *
+   * @function:
+   *   FTC_CMapCache_Lookup
+   *
+   * @description:
+   *   Translate a character code into a glyph index, using the charmap
+   *   cache.
+   *
+   * @input:
+   *   cache ::
+   *     A charmap cache handle.
